        "TileImage": "$($repository dc6a4d8b-ffab-4fd2-96cb-8c0f3590a860).Image",
        "Description": "Fabricio Giordano is the only known surviving member of the Giordano crime family, 47. It appears we overlooked his thoroughly wiped existence when we set our sights on Sapienza, but no matter. We&apos;ll simply rectify this with your discreet arrival to his band&apos;s private show in Mendoza. This is his preferred method of operation, keeping his eyes on all of the important figureheads and awaiting the perfect time to strike. Sound like somebody you know?",
